{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120199","id":3848891012,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7laWqE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120199","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120199.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120199.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120199","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120199/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120199/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120199/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b1630687cdd08bb53ac2181c5d43b06ad10c6f7f","number":120199,"state":"closed","locked":true,"title":"Add allocation-free PhysicsRayQueryResult3D and intersect_ray_into","user":{"login":"fabiano-pinheiro","id":60220768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjIwNzY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60220768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro","html_url":"https://github.com/fabiano-pinheiro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\n\n`PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.intersect_ray()` allocates and returns a new `Dictionary` (with `Variant` boxing) on every call. For games doing thousands of raycasts per frame (hitscan weapons, line-of-sight checks, foot IK), this causes memory churn and frame stutters.\n\n## Solution\n\nThis is an additive API — `intersect_ray()` is unchanged.\n\n- **`PhysicsRayQueryResult3D`**: a new `RefCounted` class holding the raycast hit data (`position`, `normal`, `face_index`, `collider_id`, `collider`, `shape`, `rid`) plus a `has_hit()` flag.\n  - `has_hit()` returns whether the last query hit something.\n  - On a miss, the object is `clear()`ed back to default values so stale data from a previous hit can't be accidentally read.\n- **`PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.intersect_ray_into(parameters, result)`**: performs the raycast and writes the result directly into the caller-provided `PhysicsRayQueryResult3D`, returning `true`/`false` for hit/miss. Reusing one instance across many calls avoids per-call allocations entirely.\n  - Safely handles a `null`/invalid `result` argument from GDScript (`ERR_FAIL_COND_V_MSG`, no crash).\n\n## Other changes\n\n- `PhysicsRayQueryResult3D` registered in `register_server_types.cpp`.\n- All getters, `has_hit()`, and `intersect_ray_into()` bound to `ClassDB`.\n- Documentation added (`doc/classes/PhysicsRayQueryResult3D.xml`, updated `PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.xml`).\n- `tests/scripts/physics/raycast_allocation_perf.gd`: a GDScript performance test running 5000 raycasts/frame using a single reused `PhysicsRayQueryResult3D`, printing `Performance.OBJECT_COUNT` to demonstrate it stays flat.\n\n## Testing\n\nBuilt the engine (linuxbsd, template_debug) and ran an end-to-end headless GDScript script:\n- Confirmed `PhysicsRayQueryResult3D` and all its methods are registered and callable from GDScript.\n- Confirmed hit/miss results are populated/cleared correctly, including reuse of one instance across hit → miss.\n- Confirmed `intersect_ray_into(query, null)` returns `false` without crashing.\n- Ran 5000 raycasts/frame for 5 frames with a single reused result object — `Performance.OBJECT_COUNT` remained perfectly flat (1383) across all frames, confirming zero per-call allocations.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":"spam","created_at":"2026-06-11T16:41:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T18:22:05Z","closed_at":"2026-06-11T16:50:07Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d801f1cf3c0dca760773c89c1f83db5d7f4298b1","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"fabiano-pinheiro:feature/physics-ray-query-result-3d","ref":"feature/physics-ray-query-result-3d","repo":{"id":1266469992,"node_id":"R_kgDOS3zMaA","name":"godot","full_name":"fabiano-pinheiro/godot","owner":{"login":"fabiano-pinheiro","id":60220768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjIwNzY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60220768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro","html_url":"https://github.com/fabiano-pinheiro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabiano-pinheiro/subscri